      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "所以……训练员。\r\n我会努力的——至少也要努力到，您愿意传颂这以我为名的故事才行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4407b772ac1ee1f4106a56c49bb085306591b57b0f4e264ee8c68e47bfce4622",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
